    # Strategy 2: Campus + IZ + Commercial Hub + Dam + Aqueduct
    # Strategy 3: Campus + IZ + Commercial Hub + Dam
    # Strategy 4: Campus + IZ + Commercial Hub + Aqueduct
    # Strategy 5: Campus + IZ + Commercial Hub
    # Strategy 6: Campus + IZ + Holy Site + Dam + Aqueduct
